 purified mind","Calmness","Self-realisation"],"L":["L2"],"say":"Lesson two. Yoga is the path to calmness for the seeker. For someone who wants a calm, meditative mind, selfless action is the proven means. And once calm is reached, calm itself becomes the vehicle for self-realisation. Action first, then stillness.","start":220.176,"at":220.752,"end":239.496,"words":[[0.113,0.463,"Lesson"],[0.588,0.463,"two"],[1.45,0.537,"Yoga"],[2.0,0.163,"is"],[2.175,0.125,"the"],[2.312,0.4,"path"],[2.725,0.113,"to"],[2.85,0.537,"calmness"],[3.4,0.1,"for"],[3.513,0.1,"the"],[3.625,0.512,"seeker"],[4.525,0.125,"For"],[4.662,0.375,"someone"],[5.05,0.113,"who"],[5.175,0.275,"wants"],[5.463,0.062,"a"],[5.537,0.475,"calm"],[6.225,0.55,"meditative"],[6.787,0.438,"mind"],[7.537,0.5,"selfless"],[8.05,0.487,"action"],[8.55,0.163,"is"],[8.725,0.113,"the"],[8.85,0.388,"proven"],[9.25,0.55,"means"],[10.2,0.138,"And"],[10.35,0.3,"once"],[10.662,0.287,"calm"],[10.963,0.138,"is"],[11.113,0.475,"reached"],[11.875,0.263,"calm"],[12.15,0.463,"itself"],[12.625,0.35,"becomes"],[12.988,0.087,"the"],[13.088,0.475,"vehicle"],[13.575,0.125,"for"],[13.713,1.15,"self-realisation"],[15.238,0.463,"Action"],[15.713,0.55,"first"],[16.525,0.225,"then"],[16.762,0.75,"stillness"]]},{"layout":"lesson","headline":"The Mind Is Your Truest Friend or Fiercest Enemy","visual":["Lift yourself by your own mind","The mind is a friend to those who master it","An enemy to those who do not"],"L":["L3"],"say":"Lesson three. The mind is your truest friend or your fiercest enemy. You rise or fall by your own mind. It becomes a friend to those who master it, and an enemy to those who do not. No one else can do this work for you.","start":239.496,"at":240.072,"end":255.84,"words":[[0.113,0.475,"Lesson"],[0.6,0.512,"three"],[1.512,0.113,"The"],[1.637,0.425,"mind"],[2.075,0.138,"is"],[2.225,0.125,"your"],[2.362,0.463,"truest"],[2.837,0.45,"friend"],[3.3,0.113,"or"],[3.425,0.175,"your"],[3.612,0.55,"fiercest"],[4.175,0.412,"enemy"],[