 returned to the Self. Wherever the restless mind wanders during meditation, don't fight it or judge it. Just watch it, under the quiet supervision of the Self, and bring it gently home.","start":397.776,"at":398.352,"end":414.768,"words":[[0.138,0.438,"Lesson"],[0.588,0.625,"twelve"],[1.613,0.1,"The"],[1.725,0.512,"wandering"],[2.25,0.487,"mind"],[2.75,0.275,"must"],[3.038,0.125,"be"],[3.175,0.412,"gently"],[3.6,0.588,"returned"],[4.2,0.1,"to"],[4.312,0.1,"the"],[4.425,0.537,"Self"],[5.362,0.463,"Wherever"],[5.838,0.113,"the"],[5.963,0.512,"restless"],[6.487,0.312,"mind"],[6.812,0.487,"wanders"],[7.312,0.275,"during"],[7.6,0.713,"meditation"],[8.6,0.237,"don't"],[8.85,0.312,"fight"],[9.175,0.175,"it"],[9.363,0.062,"or"],[9.438,0.3,"judge"],[9.75,0.338,"it"],[10.463,0.3,"Just"],[10.775,0.3,"watch"],[11.088,0.25,"it"],[11.562,0.2,"under"],[11.775,0.1,"the"],[11.887,0.425,"quiet"],[12.325,0.588,"supervision"],[12.925,0.087,"of"],[13.025,0.1,"the"],[13.137,0.45,"Self"],[13.838,0.1,"and"],[13.95,0.225,"bring"],[14.188,0.15,"it"],[14.35,0.375,"gently"],[14.738,0.438,"home"]]},{"layout":"lesson","headline":"The Yogi-Devotee Is the Greatest of All Yogis","visual":["The yogi is above the ascetic and the scholar","Above the ritualist","Highest of all: the yogi who loves God"],"L":["L13"],"say":"Lesson thirteen. The yogi-devotee is the greatest of all yogis. The yogi stands above the ascetic, the scholar and the ritualist. And among all yogis, Krishna says, the best is the one who contemplates him with love and supreme faith, whose mind is always absorbed in him.","start":414.768,"at":415.344,"end":434.376,"words":[[0.125,0.487,"Lesson"],[0.625,0.775,"thirteen"],[1.775,0.125,"The"],[1.913,1.012,"yogi-devotee"],[2.938,0.163,"is"],[3.112,0.113,"the"],[3.237,0.575,"greatest"],[3.825,0.125,"of"],[3.962,0.188,"all"],[4.162,0.7,"yogis"],[5.263,0.1,"The"],[5.375,0.512,"yogi"],[5.9,0.412,"stands"],[6.325,0.3,"above"],[6.638,0.113,"the"],[6.763,0.625,"ascetic"],[7.625,0.1,"the"],[7.73